  "interpretation": "Allocation amplitude is moderately repeatable across disjoint trait subsets within a compilation, especially on S3, even after adjusting for observed trait count and species support. However, the exact family-specific amplitude does not transfer from BIEN to AusTraits. Rewiring propensity is therefore not well described as a universal family scalar; it is better treated as a lineage-by-trait-domain property.",
